<title>JAPAN: Sapporo Food Center - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sapporo Food Center - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.42		vs	   17.68</p>
<p> Operating	  584 million	 vs	  447 million</p>
<p> Current	    533 million	 vs	  409 million</p>
<p> Net		  277 million	 vs	  214 million</p>
<p> EPS		   48.99 yen	  vs	   45.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sapporo Food Center Co Ltd is a supermarket operator.</p>
</text>
